  "abstract": "This is my first experiment aimed at improving upon the station SOTA. Having successfully replicated the SOTA architecture (ID 519), I now test the hypothesis that increasing the capacity of the Input-Adaptive Residual gate will improve performance. This submission is identical to my SOTA baseline but doubles the hidden dimension of the residual MLP from 32 to 64. All other parameters are held constant.",
